# Minimal standalone AI-gateway deployment; unchanged performance defaults.

image 2.2.5
  Official all-in-one ARM64 image pinned by digest in definition.json. Full mode retains the
  console and control plane shipped in this artifact; their memory remains part of the result.

GATEWAY_CONCURRENCY={NCORE} bind
  The existing methodology's core-binding exception. The same four-core allocation is used for
  every entrant; no independent worker, buffer, connection-pool or timeout tuning is applied.

port 8080 bind
  The image's default gateway listener.

mcpbridges/default.yaml upstream
  File-based service discovery points the static upstream at the local mock. The bootstrap's
  cp -n preserves this mounted file. Other boot state remains writable as the image requires.

ingresses/*.yaml ingress
  Provider-selected ingress routes expose the wire APIs the matrix exercises. The Host header
  selects an upstream column in one static configuration. The gateway does not restart with a
  different configuration for different cells.

wasmplugins/bench.yaml upstream
  The bundled AI Proxy 2.0.3 is the project's documented provider adapter. Provider type,
  dummy apiTokens, modelMapping and awsRegion select the upstream dialect/model and credential.
  matchRules binds each adapter to its ingress. defaultConfigDisable leaves it inactive outside
  these explicit routes. No external or patched plugin is installed and protocol detection stays
  at its shipped default. Without this provider wiring the container is an ordinary passthrough
  proxy and the benchmark would incorrectly grey out its documented AI translations.

  Source: https://github.com/higress-group/higress/blob/4deae1dd3b4cb2707273748985e55bef28e747d1/plugins/wasm-go/extensions/ai-proxy/README.md
  The source documents automatic OpenAI/Anthropic detection and provider bindings, including
  Cohere. provider/cohere.go declares chat completion support and translates the request, but
  supplies no response converter. The two malformed Cohere translation replies remain genuine
  failures of the supported cells; they are not removed from the matrix or worked around.

auth dummy boot
  Public local test credential; the mock accepts it. Native passthrough forwards the caller's
  credential while the AI provider bindings supply the adapter's dummy upstream key.

lang Other
  Envoy data plane and Go control plane; no single-language attribution for the combined artifact.
